{"games":[{"id":6321891709,"name":"🍟Work at BurgerBlox Fast Food","desc":"🍟Welcome to BurgerBlox Fast Food, where you can choose to be a customer and order some delicious menu items at the restaurant, or you can become a team member and work hard to serve customers! \n\n💝 Follow the owner: https://www.roblox.com/users/680656472/profile\n🔗 Join the group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/8927586/!/ \n\n📌 Click the \"Staff Apps\" button on the top right side in game to claim your rank, attend a training or attend a quiz. \n\n👕 Merch is under the group store!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/8927586/r#!/store\n\nTags: McDonald's, Ronald, RoDonalds, McDonalds, Cafe, Bakery, Restaurant, Roblox, Fan, Group, Coffee, Parlor, Juice Bar, Starbucks, Nova, Hotel, Waterpark, Bakiez, Pastriez, Ice Cream, FLAMINGO DIDN'T VISIT, Tips, Earn Robux,","path":"/game/6321891709-work-at-burgerblox-fast-food","slug":"6321891709-work-at-burgerblox-fast-food","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/f3ce69addc1dd7021b6566d85cc93175e2d32ac0250931a8284e89298cd30b4e.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c28ca99d8f16bcfa002a774b1172c11a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":16901361,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-08-04T18:16:33.484Z","creator":{"name":"BurgerBlox Fast Food","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6838795423,"name":"Warm Isolation","desc":"For information on why Warm Isolation now has a Restricted rating, see the post below:\nhttps://devforum.roblox.com/t/what-happened-to-warm-isolation/3920582?u=steven_scripts\n\nhang out with the guys and/or gals in a cozy bedroom\n\nIMPORTANT: Money and items don't save across servers. But if you get disconnected and still have a way to get back to the server you were in, don't worry! The server will keep your progress there for ten minutes before wiping it. (This does not apply if the last player in the server leaves, as that shuts down the server entirely.)\n\nIf a play